      <h1>Blue Cross Coverage for Wellness Care <em>Paramedical Benefits, Claims and Spending Accounts</em></h1>
      <p>This guide explains how Blue Cross plans in Canada usually treat the wellness care listed on WellFinder, including physiotherapy, massage therapy and acupuncture. It covers claiming through the member site and app for your region, direct billing at clinics, and the spending accounts many Blue Cross plans include.</p>
      <p>Blue Cross in Canada is a family of regional plans rather than one national plan. Your card names the organization that runs your coverage, and that organization sets your claim tools and answers your questions. Your employer chose the categories and amounts in your plan, so confirm them with your own Blue Cross organization before you book.</p>
      <p class="byline">By WellFinder · November 2026 · 5 min read</p>
    </div>
      </div>

  </section>

